{"suttaId":"thag16.3","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2975,3041],"vripara":"747"},"segments":{"thag16.3:0.4":"Telakānittheragāthā","thag16.3:1.1":"“Cirarattaṃ vatātāpī, dhammaṃ anuvicintayaṃ;","thag16.3:1.3":"Samaṃ cittassa nālatthaṃ, pucchaṃ samaṇabrāhmaṇe.","thag16.3:2.1":"“‘Ko so pāraṅgato loke, ko patto amatogadhaṃ;","thag16.3:2.3":"Kassa dhammaṃ paṭicchāmi, paramatthavijānanaṃ’.","thag16.3:3.1":"“Antovaṅkagato āsi, macchova ghasamāmisaṃ;","thag16.3:3.3":"Baddho mahindapāsena, vepacityasuro yathā.","thag16.3:4.1":"“Añchāmi naṃ na muñcāmi, asmā sokapariddavā;","thag16.3:4.3":"Ko me bandhaṃ muñcaṃ loke, sambodhiṃ vedayissati.","thag16.3:5.1":"“Samaṇaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ vā kaṃ, ādisantaṃ pabhaṅgunaṃ.","thag16.3:5.3":"Kassa dhammaṃ paṭicchāmi, jarāmaccupavāhanaṃ.","thag16.3:6.1":"“Vicikicchākaṅkhāganthitaṃ, sārambhabalasaññutaṃ;","thag16.3:6.3":"Kodhappattamanatthaddhaṃ, abhijappappadāraṇaṃ.","thag16.3:7.1":"“Taṇhādhanusamuṭṭhānaṃ, dve ca pannarasāyutaṃ [dvedhāpannarasāyutaṃ (?)];","thag16.3:7.3":"Passa orasikaṃ bāḷhaṃ, bhetvāna yadi [yada (sī. aṭṭha.) hadi (?)“hadaye”ti taṃsaṃvaṇṇanā] tiṭṭhati.","thag16.3:8.1":"“Anudiṭṭhīnaṃ appahānaṃ, saṅkappaparatejitaṃ;","thag16.3:8.3":"Tena viddho pavedhāmi, pattaṃva māluteritaṃ.","thag16.3:9.1":"“Ajjhattaṃ me samuṭṭhāya, khippaṃ paccati māmakaṃ;","thag16.3:9.3":"Chaphassāyatanī kāyo, yattha sarati sabbadā.","thag16.3:10.1":"“Taṃ na passāmi tekicchaṃ, yo metaṃ sallamuddhare;","thag16.3:10.3":"Nānārajjena satthena [nāraggena na satthena (?)], nāññena vicikicchitaṃ.","thag16.3:11.1":"“Ko me asattho avaṇo, sallamabbhantarapassayaṃ;","thag16.3:11.3":"Ahiṃsaṃ sabbagattāni, sallaṃ me uddharissati.","thag16.3:12.1":"“Dhammappati hi so seṭṭho, visadosappavāhako;","thag16.3:12.3":"Gambhīre patitassa me, thalaṃ pāṇiñca dassaye.","thag16.3:13.1":"“Rahadehamasmi ogāḷho, ahāriyarajamattike;","thag16.3:13.3":"Māyāusūyasārambha, thinamiddhamapatthaṭe.","thag16.3:14.1":"“Uddhaccameghathanitaṃ, saṃyojanavalāhakaṃ;","thag16.3:14.3":"Vāhā vahanti kuddiṭṭhiṃ [duddiṭṭhiṃ (sī. dha. pa.339)], saṅkappā rāganissitā.","thag16.3:15.1":"“Savanti sabbadhi sotā, latā ubbhijja tiṭṭhati;","thag16.3:15.3":"Te sote ko nivāreyya, taṃ lataṃ ko hi checchati.","thag16.3:16.1":"“Velaṃ karotha bhaddante, sotānaṃ sannivāraṇaṃ;","thag16.3:16.3":"Mā te manomayo soto, rukkhaṃva sahasā luve.","thag16.3:17.1":"“Evaṃ me bhayajātassa, apārā pāramesato;","thag16.3:17.3":"Tāṇo paññāvudho satthā, isisaṅghanisevito.","thag16.3:18.1":"“Sopāṇaṃ sugataṃ suddhaṃ, dhammasāramayaṃ daḷhaṃ;","thag16.3:18.3":"Pādāsi vuyhamānassa,‘mā bhāyī’ti ca mabravi.","thag16.3:19.1":"“Satipaṭṭhānapāsādaṃ, āruyha paccavekkhisaṃ;","thag16.3:19.3":"Yaṃ taṃ pubbe amaññissaṃ, sakkāyābhirataṃ pajaṃ.","thag16.3:20.1":"“Yadā ca maggamaddakkhiṃ, nāvāya abhirūhanaṃ;","thag16.3:20.3":"Anadhiṭṭhāya attānaṃ, titthamaddakkhimuttamaṃ.","thag16.3:21.1":"“Sallaṃ attasamuṭṭhānaṃ, bhavanettippabhāvitaṃ;","thag16.3:21.3":"Etesaṃ appavattāya [appavattiyā (?)], desesi maggamuttamaṃ.","thag16.3:22.1":"“Dīgharattānusayitaṃ, cirarattamadhiṭṭhitaṃ;","thag16.3:22.3":"Buddho mepānudī ganthaṃ, visadosappavāhano”ti.","thag16.3:22.5":"… Telakāni thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
